# Chart-analysis scratch images (assistant/chart_analysis.py) -- written
# inside the project tree rather than the OS temp dir so Claude Code's own
# Read tool can reach them without depending on --add-dir working against
# whatever the OS temp location happens to be; deleted after each request.
apps/backend/storage/tmp/

